typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Harper\" title=\"The High Harper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The High Harper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Harper\" title=\"The High Harper\">The High Harper</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_M%27alice.png/25px-Portrait_M%27alice.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_M%27alice.png/38px-Portrait_M%27alice.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_M%27alice.png/50px-Portrait_M%27alice.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death's Head of Bhaal M'alice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_M%27alice.png/25px-Portrait_M%27alice.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Portrait_M%27alice.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">Death's Head of Bhaal M'alice</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House_-_High_Security_Vaults\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Counting House - High Security Vaults\">The Counting House - High Security Vaults</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Stone_Lord\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone Lord\">Stone Lord</a> Strike Team - \n</p><p><br>\nUpdate on the Counting House operation: We've been tipped off to expect an ambush once we reach the vault, but the Guild underestimates us (as usual) and if we maintain coordination we should be able to shrug it off without casualties. Let the Stone Lord take the lead.\n</p><p><br>\nIf you deal efficiently with the cashguards, there may be time to gather additional funds before we withdraw. Bring everything to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cistern\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cistern\">Cistern</a> in the Sewers.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202512\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1841/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29773/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8537/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935611/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.899      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.899      1 -total\n 52.28%   22.949      8 Template:Icon_text\n 45.81%   20.108     19 Template:Trim\n 21.99%    9.652      2 Template:Uid\n 19.39%    8.513      4 Template:Icon_link\n 14.18%    6.223      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.30%    5.399      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.85%    4.762      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.98%    4.383      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32560-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202512 and revi